<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Token Radar — which pre-token protocol is worth farming next</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="app.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="top">
  <div>
    <h1>Token Radar</h1>
    <p class="sub">Protocols that record no token yet, ranked by what their launch would be worth — and how to farm each one.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="meta" id="meta"></div>
</header>
<main>
  <section class="controls" aria-label="Filter the board">
    <input id="q" type="search" placeholder="Search a protocol…" autocomplete="off">
    <select id="category" aria-label="Category"><option value="">All categories</option></select>
    <select id="chain" aria-label="Chain"><option value="">All chains</option></select>
    <select id="sort" aria-label="Sort by">
      <option value="implied">Sort: implied value</option>
      <option value="tvl">Sort: TVL</option>
      <option value="growth">Sort: 7-day growth</option>
      <option value="age">Sort: oldest first</option>
    </select>
    <label class="check"><input id="watchlist" type="checkbox"> Watchlist only</label>
  </section>
  <p class="count" id="count"></p>
  <section class="detail" id="detail" hidden></section>
  <table>
    <thead><tr>
      <th class="num">#</th><th>Protocol</th><th>Category</th><th>Chains</th>
      <th class="num">TVL</th><th class="num">7d</th><th class="num">Implied value</th>
    </tr></thead>
    <tbody id="rows"></tbody>
  </table>
  <p class="empty" id="empty" hidden>No protocol matches these filters.</p>
</main>
<footer>
  <p>Snapshot: DefiLlama protocols, fetched 2026-11-14. “Records no token” means DefiLlama's record carries no token — it is not proof a protocol has none. Implied values are this entry's own model, not a prediction that a token will launch. Farm steps are general guidance, not financial advice; never pay anyone to claim an airdrop.</p>
</footer>
<script src="data.js"></script>
<script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
